"Off by default.** Leaving it Off prevents the use of crystal symmetry to "
"reduce the mesh to its irreducible k-points, which substantially "
"increases the calculation time (see :doc:`../kpoints/index`: "
":doc:`../kpoints/reproduction`)."

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:147
msgid "1. エネルギー曲線（SCF計算）"
msgstr "1. Energy Curve (SCF Calculations)"

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:149
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"計算機能「自己無撞着電子状態計算（SCF）」で、構造ファイルごとにJobを作り、実行します。\\ 60 "
"Ryでは13個すべて、40、80、100、120 Ryでは3.60〜3.68 Åの5個を計算します（合計33件）。\\ "
"Quloud（Ver.7.0.2）は、3辺が等しく角が60°のセルを、QEの入力で ``ibrav = 2`` （fcc）、 ``A`` = "
"立方晶の格子定数（Å）として書きます（それより前の版は :numref:`{number}節 <sec-cl-repro-notes>` ）。\\"
" 3.64 Å・60 RyのJobの入力ファイル ``QuloudJob.scf.in`` は、k点メッシュが24×24×24であることを除いて、"
" :doc:`../kpoints/index` の :doc:`../kpoints/reproduction` に示したものと同じです。\\ "
"1件の計算時間は、60 Ryで約20秒、120 Ryで約2.5分です。"
msgstr ""
"Use \"Single-Point SCF\" (a self-consistent electronic structure "
"calculation) to create and run a Job for each structure file. \\ At 60 "
"Ry, calculate all 13 structures; at 40, 80, 100, and 120 Ry, calculate "
"the 5 structures from 3.60 to 3.68 Å (33 Jobs in total). \\ Quloud "
"(Ver.7.0.2) writes a cell with three equal edges and 60° angles in the QE"
" input as ``ibrav = 2`` (fcc) with ``A`` set to the cubic lattice "
"constant in Å (for earlier versions, see :numref:`Section {number} <sec-"
"cl-repro-notes>`). \\ Except for the 24×24×24 k-point mesh, the input "
"file ``QuloudJob.scf.in`` for the 3.64 Å Job at 60 Ry is the same as the "
"one in :doc:`../kpoints/index`: :doc:`../kpoints/reproduction`. \\ Each "
"calculation took about 20 seconds at 60 Ry and about 2.5 minutes at 120 "
"Ry."

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:158
msgid "2. 格子定数最適化（vc-relax）"
msgstr "2. Lattice Constant Optimization (vc-relax)"

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:160
msgid ""
"計算機能「格子定数最適化」で、共通の設定に加えて次の項目を設定します。\\ 3.64 Åからは5つのカットオフ（40、60、80、100、120 "
"Ry）で、3.56 Åと3.72 Åからは60 Ryで実行します（合計7件。やり直しの1件は、この節の最後で述べます）。"
msgstr ""
"To optimize the lattice constant, use the \"Lattice Optimization\" "
"feature and set the following fields in addition to the common settings. "
"\\ Run from 3.64 Å at five cutoffs (40, 60, 80, 100, and 120 Ry) and from"
" 3.56 Å and 3.72 Å at 60 Ry (7 Jobs in total; the one restart Job is "
"described at the end of this section)."

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:170
msgid "応力の収束閾値"
msgstr "Stress Convergence Threshold"

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:171
msgid "0.01 GPa"
msgstr "0.01 GPa"

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:172
