#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:180
msgid "0.05 eV/Å"
msgstr "0.05 eV/Å"

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:183
msgid ""
"**応力の収束閾値の既定値0.5 GPa（5 kbar）は、この記事の目的には粗すぎます。** 圧力1 kbarは格子定数の約0.001 "
"Åに相当するので、5 kbarでは0.005 Å程度の誤差が残りえます。\\ "
"1原子のfccの原始胞では、対称性により原子に力ははたらかないので、力の収束閾値は結果に影響しません。"
msgstr ""
"**The default \"Stress Convergence Threshold\" of 0.5 GPa (5 kbar) is too"
" coarse for this example.** A pressure difference of 1 kbar corresponds "
"to about 0.001 Å in the lattice constant, so a threshold of 5 kbar can "
"leave an error of about 0.005 Å. \\ In the one-atom fcc primitive cell, "
"symmetry gives zero force on the atom, so the force convergence threshold"
" does not affect the result."

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:186
msgid "3.64 Å・60 RyのJobの入力ファイルは次のようになります。"
msgstr "The input file for the Job at 3.64 Å and 60 Ry is as follows."

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:188
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"&control\n"
" calculation = 'vc-relax'\n"
" prefix = 'QuloudJob'\n"
" tstress = .true.\n"
" tprnfor = .true.\n"
" pseudo_dir = './'\n"
" outdir = './work'\n"
" verbosity = 'high'\n"
" nstep = 100\n"
" forc_conv_thr = 0.00194463\n"
"/\n"
"&system\n"
" nat = 1\n"
" ntyp = 1\n"
" ibrav = 2\n"
" A = 3.639999995023336\n"
" ecutwfc = 60.0\n"
" ecutrho = 600.0\n"
" occupations = 'smearing'\n"
" smearing = 'marzari-vanderbilt'\n"
" degauss = 0.020000\n"
"/\n"
"&electrons\n"
" electron_maxstep = 100\n"
" conv_thr = 1.00e-12\n"
" diagonalization = 'david'\n"
"/\n"
"&ions\n"
" ion_dynamics = 'bfgs'\n"
"/\n"
"&cell\n"
" cell_dynamics = 'bfgs'\n"
" press_conv_thr = 0.1000\n"
" press = 0.0000\n"
"/\n"
"ATOMIC_SPECIES\n"
"Cu 63.546 Cu.pbe-dn-kjpaw_psl.1.0.0.UPF\n"
"ATOMIC_POSITIONS {crystal}\n"
"Cu 0.0 0.0 0.0\n"
"K_POINTS automatic\n"
"24 24 24 0 0 0"
