#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:232
msgid ""
"QEの ``press_conv_thr`` の単位はkbarなので、0.01 GPaは ``0.1000`` と書かれます。\\ 出力ファイル "
"``QuloudJob.scf.out`` では、最後の ``Begin final coordinates`` から ``End final "
"coordinates`` の間に最適化後のセルが書かれます。\\ その後の ``The G-vectors are recalculated "
"for the final unit cell`` に続くSCF計算の ``P=`` "
"が、平面波を選び直したときの圧力（記事の「最後のSCFの圧力」）です。\\ 1件の計算時間は、60 Ryで約2〜7分、120 Ryで約8分です。"
msgstr ""
"QE specifies ``press_conv_thr`` in kbar, so 0.01 GPa is written as "
"``0.1000``. \\ In the output file ``QuloudJob.scf.out``, the optimized "
"cell is written between the last ``Begin final coordinates`` and ``End "
"final coordinates``. \\ The ``P=`` of the SCF calculation that follows "
"``The G-vectors are recalculated for the final unit cell`` is the "
"pressure with the reselected plane waves (the \"final SCF pressure\" in "
"the article). \\ Each calculation took about 2–7 minutes at 60 Ry and "
"about 8 minutes at 120 Ry."

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:237
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"記事のやり直しの計算（3.6287 Åから）は、3.56 "
"Åから始めたJobの最適化後の格子定数で原始胞のCIFを作り、同じ設定で実行したものです。\\ 最適化後の立方晶の格子定数 :math:`a` "
"は、 ``Begin final coordinates`` の後の ``CELL_PARAMETERS (alat= ...)`` の "
"``alat`` （bohr）と、1行目の最初の成分 :math:`x` から :math:`a = "
"2|x|\\times\\mathrm{alat}\\times0.529177` Åで求まります。"
msgstr ""
"For the restart in the article (from 3.6287 Å), we created a primitive-"
"cell CIF with the optimized lattice constant of the Job started at 3.56 Å"
" and ran it with the same settings. \\ The optimized cubic lattice "
"constant :math:`a` follows from ``alat`` (in bohr) in ``CELL_PARAMETERS "
"(alat= ...)`` after ``Begin final coordinates`` and the first component "
":math:`x` of the first row as :math:`a = "
"2|x|\\times\\mathrm{alat}\\times0.529177` Å."

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:241
msgid "3. 出力のダウンロードと解析"
msgstr "3. Downloading and Analyzing the Output"

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:243
msgid ""
"各Jobの詳細画面の「ファイル」で「出力ファイル」に切り替え、「一括ダウンロード」でZIPを取得します。\\ "
"ダウンロードしたZIPを1つのフォルダ（例えば ``downloads`` ）に集め、そのフォルダを指定して解析スクリプトを実行します。"
msgstr ""
"On each Job's details page, open \"Files\", switch to \"Output Files\", "
"and use \"Batch Download\" to get the ZIP archive. \\ Put the downloaded "
"ZIP archives in one folder, such as ``downloads``, and pass that folder "
"to the analysis script."

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:246
msgid "python analyze_cu_lattice.py downloads"
msgstr "python analyze_cu_lattice.py downloads"

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:250
msgid ""
"スクリプトは、フォルダの中のZIPを1つずつ開き、pw.xの出力（ ``Program PWSCF`` "
"を含むファイル）と、同じフォルダにある入力のコピー（ ``K_POINTS`` を含むファイル）から、次の内容を読み取ってJobを判定します。"
msgstr ""
"The script opens each ZIP archive in the folder. To identify the Job, it "
"reads the following information from the pw.x output (the file containing"
" ``Program PWSCF``) and the copy of the input in the same folder (the "
"file containing ``K_POINTS``)."

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:252
msgid "計算の種類（入力の ``calculation`` が ``'scf'`` か ``'vc-relax'`` か）"
msgstr ""
"Calculation type (whether ``calculation`` in the input is ``'scf'`` or "
"``'vc-relax'``)"

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:253
msgid ""
"格子定数（出力の ``lattice parameter (alat)`` 。 ``ibrav = 2`` の場合は立方晶の格子定数。 ``vc-"
"relax`` では開始時の値）"
msgstr ""
"Lattice constant (``lattice parameter (alat)`` in the output, which is "
"the cubic lattice constant for ``ibrav = 2`` and the starting value for "
"``vc-relax``)"

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:254
msgid "カットオフエネルギー（出力の ``kinetic-energy cutoff`` ）"
msgstr "Cutoff energy (``kinetic-energy cutoff`` in the output)"

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:256
msgid ""
"ZIPの名前やファイル名は判定に使わないので、ダウンロードしたままの名前で構いません。\\ 展開したフォルダを指定することもできます。\\ "
"同じ条件のJobが複数あるときは、最初の1つだけを使います。\\ 判定の結果を最初に表示し、続いて記事中の数値を表示して、図を "
"``figures`` フォルダに書き出します（ ``--figures`` で変更できます）。\\ "
"一部の計算だけを行った場合は、そのJobから求められる数値と図だけを出力します。"
msgstr ""
"The script does not use ZIP names or filenames to identify Jobs, so you "
"can keep the downloaded names. \\ You can also pass a folder of extracted"
" files. \\ If there are multiple Jobs with the same conditions, the "
"script uses only the first one. \\ It first reports the Jobs it "
"identified, then prints the numerical results and writes the figures to "
"the ``figures`` folder, which you can change with ``--figures``. \\ If "
"you run only some of the calculations, the script outputs only the values"
" and figures that those Jobs provide."

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:262
msgid "記事の数値と図は、上の「記事の計算の出力」のZIPを1つのフォルダに集めて、同じように実行すると得られます。"
msgstr ""
"To reproduce the numerical results and figures in the article, put the "
"ZIP archives from \"Output from the Calculations in This Article\" above "
"in one folder and run the script in the same way."

